# Exclude env files in general (local .env / *.local may hold secrets), but
# re-include the committed PUBLIC_*-only mode files: the build inside the
# image loads .env.staging or .env.production via `vite build --mode`, and
# `svelte-kit sync` reads .env.development so `pnpm check` sees the same
# $env/static/public declarations as local dev. Without the re-includes the
# build fails loudly on the missing PUBLIC_ALLOW_INDEXING declaration.
.env*
!.env.development
!.env.staging
!.env.production
*.log
.DS_Store
